# ── Secrets ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The pairing certificate and its private key are a durable credential that
# controls the device. They live outside the repository by default (~/stb-lab),
# and these patterns are a second line of defence against committing them.
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
*.p12

# ── OS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
